{% extends 'base.html.twig' %}
{% block title %}A Message to Teenagers | Area 75{% endblock %}
{% block body %}
<div class="page-title-bar">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="breadcrumb"><a href="{{ path('app_home') }}">Home</a> › <a href="#">About</a> › <span>Message to Teens</span></div>
    <h1>A Message to Teenagers…</h1>
    <p>How to tell when drinking is becoming a problem</p>
  </div>
</div>
<div class="page-content">
  <div class="container" style="max-width:760px;">
    <div class="card" style="margin-bottom:2rem;">
      <p style="font-size:1.05rem; margin-bottom:1.25rem;">Ask yourself these questions honestly:</p>
      <ol style="font-size:1rem; line-height:2.1; color:var(--text-primary);">
        <li>Do you drink because you have problems? To relax?</li>
        <li>Do you drink when you get mad at other people, your friends or parents?</li>
        <li>Do you prefer to drink alone, rather than with others?</li>
        <li>Are your grades starting to slip? Are you goofing off on your job?</li>
        <li>Did you ever try to stop drinking or drink less — and fail?</li>
        <li>Have you begun to drink in the morning, before school or work?</li>
        <li>Do you gulp your drinks?</li>
        <li>Do you ever have loss of memory due to your drinking?</li>
        <li>Do you lie about your drinking?</li>
        <li>Do you ever get into trouble when you're drinking?</li>
        <li>Do you get drunk when you drink, even when you don't mean to?</li>
        <li>Do you think it's cool to be able to hold your liquor?</li>
      </ol>
    </div>

    <div class="panel" style="background:var(--cream-dark); border-color:var(--terracotta); text-align:center;">
      <p style="font-size:1.05rem; margin-bottom:1rem;">
        If you can answer <strong>yes</strong> to any one of these questions, maybe it's time you took a serious look at what your drinking might be doing to you.
      </p>
      <p style="margin-bottom:1rem;">
        If you need help or would like to talk to someone about your drinking, call us at Alcoholics Anonymous.
      </p>
      <a href="{{ path('app_page', {slug: 'aaresources'}) }}" class="btn btn-primary">See AA Resources & Phone Numbers →</a>
    </div>

    <p style="font-size:.85rem; color:var(--text-muted); margin-top:1.5rem;">
      Reprinted from: <em>A Message to Teenagers</em>, F-9, copyright 1988 by AA World Services, Inc., with permission from the General Services Office.
    </p>
  </div>
</div>
{% endblock %}
